			"notes": "First release of Elytra Buff for Fabric and NeoForge, Minecraft 1.21.1 – 26.3.\n\n- **Cold start**: crouch on the ground with an elytra on to gather strength for one mighty wing beat, release to be thrown 16 blocks into the air.\n- **Endless flight**: diving regains 50 % more speed, so diving and pulling up keeps a flight going forever.\n- **Wing flaps**: crouch while flying to flap the wings for extra speed, for a few seconds at a time.\n- The wings visibly rise, beat and strike down, for players with the mod on their client.\n- In-game config screen with range checks and reset to defaults.\n\nThe cold start works for every player with the mod on the server; endless flight, wing flaps and the animations need the mod on the client too.\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/welles/minecraft-elytra-buff/commits/v1.0.0"
		}
